filenumber 632792
! CONTROL for the phi-vs-beta confound in sweep_storage.png.
! That sweep varies beta at phi = 0.01 for four points, then moves phi to
! 0.005 for the fifth (632721), because phi*beta = 5e-12 needs beta = 5e-10
! at phi = 0.01, below the 1e-9 floor in the physical-ranges table. So two
! parameters differ between 632721 and the rest of its own sweep -- and
! 632721 is both the sweep endpoint and one of three runs passing both
! targets. Nothing in the archive tests whether the storage PRODUCT is the
! sole control. This run does.
!
! phi 0.01 x beta 5e-10 = phi*beta 5e-12.
! DIRECT twin of 632721 (phi 0.005, beta 1e-9). beta 5e-10 is BELOW the 1e-9 physical floor and is used only to isolate phi.
! If the twins agree, phi*beta is the only thing that matters and the sweep
! stands. If they disagree, sweep_storage.png is confounded at its endpoint
! and has to be redone as a pure beta sweep over 1e-11 to 3e-11.
! permev F, muinit 0.46, sigmainit 27.99, Taiyi perm map, dc 1e-4, 8 d --
! identical to res632721.in apart from phi and beta.
! STORAGE AT THE PHYSICAL FLOOR, enhancement OFF.
! Storage is the only lever that raises lambda without suppressing initiation:
! phi*beta 3e-11 -> lambda 0.0236, 2e-11 -> 0.0492 at muinit 0.46.
! Enhancement is ruled out -- 632701/703/707/709/711 all produced NO slip even
! with a +5.8 MPa margin, because at kL 1e-5 it bleeds pf below dp_crit.
! phi 0.01 x beta 5e-10 = 5.0e-12. beta 5e-10 is already the stiff edge of
! defensible (water alone is 4.4e-10 /Pa); phi 0.01 halves the product again.
! sigmainit 27.99, muinit 0.46 -> tau0 12.88 MPa (Taiyi 15.0), dp_crit 6.53.
! If lambda still falls short here, the front cannot be matched in this
! configuration at ANY physically admissible storage.

problem 3dp
imax 601
jmax 601
ds 0.020

interval 30
nstep 400000
tmax 0.02191781
dtmax 43200
dtout 0.0002
parameterfromfile T
parameter_file "perm_taiyi_601_ds20.txt"
parameter_file_ncol 1
backslip T
vpl 0d0
a 0.015
b 0.012
dc 1e-4
f0 0.6
muinit 0.46
sigmainit 27.99
velinit 1d-12
limitsigma T
minsig 1
velmin 1d-20

pressurediffusion T
permev F

kp 4e-13
phi 0.01
beta 5e-10
eta 0.89e-3

kL 1e-3
kT 1e15

pfinit 0d0
bcl Dirichlet
bcr Dirichlet
bct Dirichlet
bcb Dirichlet
pbcl 0d0
pbcr 0d0
pbct 0d0
pbcb 0d0

injectionfromfile T

injection_file "june_clean.txt"


rigid 24
Sw_fwid 7.4e-9
rw 8.9e-2
